# magic(5) pattern for tarzan archives — random-access, seekable .tar.zst
# with an embedded table-of-contents index.
# https://github.com/astraw/tarzan-rs
#
# Layout of the leading identity frame:
#   offset 0   lelong  0x184d2a54   zstd skippable-frame magic
#   offset 4   lelong               skippable-frame payload size
#   offset 8   string  "TRZN"       tarzan payload identifier
#   offset 12  byte    0x01         frame type (identity)
#   offset 13  byte                 format version
#
0	lelong		0x184d2a54
>8	string		TRZN
>>12	byte		1
>>>13	byte		x		tarzan archive v%d
!:mime	application/x-tarzan
